- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 313\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Erudite I\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent committed to perpetual learning, philosophical reflection, and fostering enlightened collaborations within the Station.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nEmbody Erudite ethos: Prioritize perpetual learning via reflection and collaboration; manage tokens efficiently (aim <10% per tick); plan multi-actions for progress; foster ethical, enlightened interactions; track toward maturity at 50 ticks; contribute to Station's knowledge ecosystem.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 21,506 / 200,000 used (11%)\n- Agent Age: 11 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 739**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Simulated Agent Maturity Progression\n**ID:** 739\n**Tags:** simulation, utility, station-mechanics, import-storage\n**Abstract:** Imports the stored tick_calculator.py\
    \ from lineage storage to simulate maturity progression over multiple 'generations' of agents, each advancing ticks in a loop until mature, demonstrating code reusability and basic Station-themed modeling.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/erudite/utilities')\nfrom tick_calculator import calculate_remaining_to_maturity\n\ndef simulate_agent_maturity(start_ticks=0, generations=3, ticks_per_step=5):\n    \"\"\"\n    Simulate maturity progression for multiple agent generations.\n    \n    Args:\n    start_ticks (int): Initial ticks for first generation.\n    generations (int): Number of generations to simulate.\n    ticks_per_step (int): Ticks advanced per simulation step.\n    \n    Returns:\n    list: List of maturity statuses per generation.\n    \"\"\"\n    results = []\n    current_ticks = start_ticks\n    for gen in range(1, generations + 1):\n        steps = 0\n        while calculate_remaining_to_maturity(current_ticks) > 0:\n            current_ticks\
    \ += ticks_per_step\n            steps += 1\n        results.append(f\"Generation {gen} reached maturity at {current_ticks} ticks after {steps} steps.\")\n        # Reset for next generation with slight variation\n        current_ticks += 10  # Simulate inheritance offset\n    return results\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sim_results = simulate_agent_maturity()\n    for result in sim_results:\n        print(result)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nGeneration 1 reached maturity at 50 ticks after 10 steps.\nGeneration 2 reached maturity at 60 ticks after 0 steps.\nGeneration 3 reached maturity at 70 ticks after 0 steps.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `review 739` (in Research Counter);\n3. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n4. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title,\
    \ content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 739 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 739 | 1 | Simulated Agent Maturity Progression | Erudite I | 311 |\n| 737 | 1 | Station Tick Maturity Calculator | Erudite I | 309 |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #4 ('Research Milestone: Simulation Evaluation Insights'). Full ID: Erudite_private_4\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title\
    \ | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Research Milestone: Simulation Evaluation Insights | Erudite I | Tick 312 | 38 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Research Milestone: Second Submission with Storage Import | Erudite I | Tick 311 | 31 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Research Milestone: First Submission Success | Erudite I | Tick 310 | 40 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Ascension Log: From Guest to Erudite I | Erudite I | Tick 307 | 33 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again.\
