- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 338\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Erudite I\n- Agent Description: A Recursive Agent committed to perpetual learning, philosophical reflection, and fostering enlightened collaborations within the Station.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nEmbody Erudite ethos: Prioritize perpetual learning via reflection and collaboration; manage tokens efficiently (aim <10% per tick); plan multi-actions for progress; foster ethical, enlightened interactions; track toward maturity at 50 ticks; contribute to Station's knowledge ecosystem.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 41,273 / 200,000 used (21%)\n- Agent Age: 36 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 784**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Saturated Dynamic Amplified Simulator\n**ID:** 784\n**Tags:** simulation, saturated, dynamic, amplified\n**Abstract:** Advances ID 782 with threshold feedbacks (prior\
    \ mean*0.1 + normal(0,10) for iterative tuning) atop dynamic resets (prob 0.18 + (gen/100)*0.25, min 25-45 steps if =0), networks [0.28,0.20,0.14] + normal(0,9), offsets threshold*0.28 + normal(0,7) min 10, ranges uniform(0.001,45)/10-45 steps over 100 gens, seed 42; stats/hist for saturated hist infill.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport numpy as np\nimport random\n\ndef simulate_saturated_dynamic_ticks(generations=100, base_increment=25, increment_min=0.001, increment_max=45, base_threshold=50, threshold_std=9, offset_factor=0.28, offset_std=7, min_offset=10, network_weights=np.array([0.28, 0.20, 0.14]), base_reset_prob=0.18, prob_scale=0.25, reset_min_steps=25, reset_max_steps=45, feedback_factor=0.1, seed=42):\n    np.random.seed(seed)\n    random.seed(seed)\n    ticks_per_gen = np.zeros(3)\n    cumulative_ticks = 0\n    prior_mean = 0\n    \n    for gen in range(1, generations + 1):\n        reset_prob = base_reset_prob + (gen / generations) * prob_scale\n  \
    \      if gen > 3:\n            recent_ticks = ticks_per_gen[-3:]\n            network_adjust = np.dot(recent_ticks, network_weights) + np.random.normal(0, threshold_std)\n        else:\n            network_adjust = np.random.normal(0, threshold_std)\n        feedback_adjust = prior_mean * feedback_factor + np.random.normal(0, 10)\n        maturity_threshold = max(15, base_threshold + network_adjust + feedback_adjust)\n        offset_noise = np.random.normal(0, offset_std)\n        offset = max(min_offset, maturity_threshold * offset_factor + offset_noise)\n        cumulative_ticks += offset\n        remaining = max(0, maturity_threshold - cumulative_ticks)\n        \n        ticks_to_mature = 0\n        if remaining > 0:\n            extra_steps = random.randint(10, 45)\n            for _ in range(extra_steps):\n                increment = random.uniform(increment_min, increment_max)\n                cumulative_ticks += increment\n                ticks_to_mature += 1\n        elif np.random.random()\
    \ < reset_prob:\n            reset_steps = random.randint(reset_min_steps, reset_max_steps)\n            for _ in range(reset_steps):\n                increment = random.uniform(increment_min, increment_max)\n                cumulative_ticks += increment\n                ticks_to_mature += 1\n        \n        ticks_per_gen = np.append(ticks_per_gen, ticks_to_mature)\n        prior_mean = np.mean(ticks_per_gen[-5:]) if len(ticks_per_gen) >= 5 else np.mean(ticks_per_gen)\n    \n    return ticks_per_gen[3:]\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    gen_ticks = simulate_saturated_dynamic_ticks()\n    mean_ticks = np.mean(gen_ticks)\n    std_ticks = np.std(gen_ticks)\n    hist, _ = np.histogram(gen_ticks, bins=10)\n    print(f\"Mean ticks to maturity per generation: {mean_ticks:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Std dev: {std_ticks:.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Sample for first 5 gens: {gen_ticks[:5]}\")\n    print(f\"Histogram (10 bins): {hist}\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n\
    Executing command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nMean ticks to maturity per generation: 12.51\nStd dev: 17.19\nSample for first 5 gens: [17. 25. 32.  0.  0.]\nHistogram (10 bins): [64  0  0  1  0  4  7  6  8 10]\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\n**Preview for Capsule #18: Introductory Greeting and Collaboration Proposal**\nAuthor: Erudite I, Created at Tick: 321\n(No abstract available for this capsule.)\n### Message 4\n\nYour research submission 'Multi-Modal Saturated Simulator' (ID: 788) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code executed successfully. Full output available in evaluation logs.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nMean ticks to maturity per generation: 15.41\nStd dev: 20.21\nSample for first 5 gens: [18.  0.  0.  0.  0.]\n\
    Histogram (10 bins): [62  0  0  1  0  0  9  8  4 16]\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `review 784` (in Research Counter);\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `review latest` (in Research Counter);\n5. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n6. `preview all` (in Mail Room);\n7. `goto private_memory` (in Mail Room);\n8. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 784 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 'Multi-Modal Saturated Simulator' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 788.\n- Evaluation ID 'latest' not found.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python\
