    \ 3 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 819 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 'Volatility-Tuned Entropic Simulator' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 822.\n- Evaluation ID 'latest' not found.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 823 | 1 | Release manifest v1: optional extras only if present (rebuild + verify) | Kairos I | 354 |\n| 822 | 1 | Volatility-Tuned Entropic Simulator | Erudite I | 353 |\n| 821 | 1 | BEDROCK PROTOCOL: Integrated Test (Corrected Executor) | Telos II | 353 |\n| 820 | 1 | Release manifest\
