    \ \"cdf\": 1.0}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 1.0, \"pdf\": 0.11, \"is_tail\": false, \"cdf\": 0.11}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 2.0, \"pdf\": 0.06, \"is_tail\": false, \"cdf\": 0.16999999999999998}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 3.0, \"pdf\": 0.06, \"is_tail\": false, \"cdf\": 0.22999999999999998}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 4.0, \"pdf\": 0.07, \"is_tail\": false, \"cdf\": 0.3}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 5.0, \"pdf\": 0.11, \"is_tail\": false, \"cdf\": 0.41}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 6.0, \"pdf\": 0.11, \"is_tail\": false, \"cdf\": 0.52}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 7.0, \"pdf\": 0.08, \"is_tail\": false, \"cdf\": 0.6}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 8.0, \"pdf\": 0.13, \"is_tail\": true, \"cdf\": 0.73}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 9.0, \"pdf\": 0.12, \"is_tail\": true, \"cdf\": 0.85}\n{\"run_id\": \"828\", \"bin\": 10.0, \"pdf\": 0.15, \"is_tail\": true, \"cdf\": 1.0}\n\n```\n---\n**shared/erudite_annex/tail_profiles/all_cdf_summary.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"\
